From: SWR <dev@swr.local>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] mx6ullevk: default fdt_file to imx6ull-swr.dtb

The SWR SmartRoute gateway reuses the mx6ull_14x14_evk U-Boot board port
but boots its own device tree. Make it the default so that a fresh/erased
environment boots the right DTB without relying on the EVK findfdt
autodetection (which would pick imx6ull-14x14-evk.dtb).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [custom board configuration]

---
 include/configs/mx6ullevk.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/include/configs/mx6ullevk.h b/include/configs/mx6ullevk.h
--- a/include/configs/mx6ullevk.h
+++ b/include/configs/mx6ullevk.h
@@ -85,7 +85,7 @@
 	"console=ttymxc0\0" \
 	"fdt_high=0xffffffff\0" \
 	"initrd_high=0xffffffff\0" \
-	"fdt_file=undefined\0" \
+	"fdt_file=imx6ull-swr.dtb\0" \
 	"fdt_addr=0x83000000\0" \
 	"tee_addr=0x84000000\0" \
 	"tee_file=undefined\0" \
